@startuml activity_workflow_5
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam swimlaneWidth 170

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #475569
skinparam ActivityBorderThickness 1.2
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.1

title **Workflow 5: Detect, Handle and Close a Security Incident**

|#FEF3C7|Camera & AI Service|
|#F0FDF4|Backend & Storage|
|#EDE9FE|Guard|
|#E0F2FE|Facility Manager / Admin|

|Camera & AI Service|
start
:Step 1: The AI finds a stranger or\nan unauthorized person in an area;\nthe system creates an incident\nwhose severity follows the\nincident policy;

|Backend & Storage|
:Step 2: The system invites the guards\non duty in the same building;

if (Claimed before invitation expires?) then (Yes)
  :Assign incident to claiming guard;
else (No)
  :Send invitation to all guards on duty;
  if (Claimed by any guard?) then (Yes)
    :Assign incident;
  else (No)
    |Facility Manager / Admin|
    :Notify Facility Manager;
    |Backend & Storage|
  endif
endif

|Guard|
:Step 3: One guard taps Claim.\nOther guards see that the incident\nhas already been claimed;

:Step 4: The guard taps Find Route;\nthe mobile application shows the\nwalking route to the area;

fork
  |Camera & AI Service|
  :Step 5: The system records evidence\nvideo from the moment the incident\nstarts until there is no detection;
fork again
  |Guard|
  :Step 6: The guard handles the\nsituation on site and Camera guard\nchecks the live view to make sure\nthe area is safe;

  :Step 7: The guard concludes:\nVerified (real intrusion) or\nDismissed (false alarm), with a\ncategory and a note;
end fork

|Backend & Storage|
:Step 8: The system closes the incident,\nstores the evidence video and updates\nthe false alarm statistics;

|Facility Manager / Admin|
:Step 9: The Facility Manager or\nAdministrator selects a date range,\nviews the security summary report and\ndownloads it as PDF (number of incidents,\nfalse alarm rate, average response time,\nareas with most incidents, guards with\nmost resolved incidents);

stop
@enduml
